            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the top-rated tower defense franchise in this free head-to-head strategy game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's monkey vs monkey for the first time ever - go head to head with other players in a Bloon-popping battle for victory. From the creators of best-selling Bloons TD 6, this game is specially designed for intense multiplayer combat, featuring over 50 custom head-to-head tracks, incredible towers and upgrades, all-new range of powers, and the ability to control bloons directly and send them charging past your opponent's defenses. Easy to learn, hard to master - this game offers endless fun for casual and competitive players alike!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check out these awesome features!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Head-to-head two player Bloons TD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Over 50 custom Battles tracks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* 22 awesome monkey towers, each with 8 powerful upgrades, including the never before seen C.O.B.R.A. Tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple ways to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Assault Mode - manage strong defenses and send bloons directly against your opponent</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Defense Mode - build up your income and outlast your challenger with your superior defenses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Battle Arenas - Put your medallions on the line in a high stakes Assault game. Winner takes all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Card Battles - Build the ultimate deck to slam your opponents in this unique twist on bloons TD gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even more awesomeness! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* All new Powers - supercharge your towers, boost your bloons, or try the new sabotage, eco, and track powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Battle it out for top scores on the weekly leaderboards and win awesome prizes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Create and join private matches to challenge any of your friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Build your clan and work together to be the best of the best for weekly rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Customize your bloons with decals, or grab new tower skins so your victory has a signature stamp</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* 16 cool achievements to claim</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >REQUIRES INTERNET CONNECTION</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**********</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ninja Kiwi Notes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please review our Terms of Service and Privacy Policy. You will be prompted in-game to accept these terms in order to cloud save and protect your game progress:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloons TD Battles contains in-game items that can be purchased with real money. You can disable in-app purchases in your device’s settings, or reach us at <u></u> for help. Your purchases fund our development updates and new games, and we sincerely appreciate every vote of confidence you give us with your purchases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ninja Kiwi Community:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We love hearing from our players, so please get in touch with any feedback, positive or negative, at <u></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streamers and Video Creators:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ninja Kiwi is actively promoting channel creators on YouTube and Twitch! If you are not already working with us, keep making videos and tell us about your channel at <a href=\"mailto:streamers@ninjakiwi.com\">streamers@ninjakiwi.com</a>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the top-rated tower defense franchise in this free head-to-head strategy game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's monkey vs monkey for the first time ever - go head to head with other players in a Bloon-popping battle for victory. From the creators of best-selling Bloons TD 6, this game is specially designed for intense multiplayer combat, featuring over 50 custom head-to-head tracks, incredible towers and upgrades, all-new range of powers, and the ability to control bloons directly and send them charging past your opponent's defenses. Easy to learn, hard to master - this game offers endless fun for casual and competitive players alike!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check out these awesome features!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Head-to-head two player Bloons TD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Over 50 custom Battles tracks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* 22 awesome monkey towers, each with 8 powerful upgrades, including the never before seen C.O.B.R.A. Tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple ways to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Assault Mode - manage strong defenses and send bloons directly against your opponent</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Defense Mode - build up your income and outlast your challenger with your superior defenses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Battle Arenas - Put your medallions on the line in a high stakes Assault game. Winner takes all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Card Battles - Build the ultimate deck to slam your opponents in this unique twist on bloons TD gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even more awesomeness! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* All new Powers - supercharge your towers, boost your bloons, or try the new sabotage, eco, and track powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Battle it out for top scores on the weekly leaderboards and win awesome prizes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Create and join private matches to challenge any of your friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Build your clan and work together to be the best of the best for weekly rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Customize your bloons with decals, or grab new tower skins so your victory has a signature stamp</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* 16 cool achievements to claim</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >REQUIRES INTERNET CONNECTION</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**********</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ninja Kiwi Notes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please review our Terms of Service and Privacy Policy. You will be prompted in-game to accept these terms in order to cloud save and protect your game progress:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloons TD Battles contains in-game items that can be purchased with real money. You can disable in-app purchases in your device’s settings, or reach us at <u></u> for help. Your purchases fund our development updates and new games, and we sincerely appreciate every vote of confidence you give us with your purchases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ninja Kiwi Community:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We love hearing from our players, so please get in touch with any feedback, positive or negative, at <u></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streamers and Video Creators:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ninja Kiwi is actively promoting channel creators on YouTube and Twitch! If you are not already working with us, keep making videos and tell us about your channel at <a href=\"mailto:streamers@ninjakiwi.com\">streamers@ninjakiwi.com</a>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
